* C1: inductively-degenerated cascode CS LNA (Shaeffer & Lee, JSSC 1997).
* Structure-only transcription incl. the published BIAS NETWORK: current-
* mirror reference (R1 -> diode NM3) feeding the input gate through R2;
* input DC-blocked (C1); cascode gate at VDD (AC ground). v0.2 after v0/v0.1
* dead-bias forensics: default harness bias rules insert nothing for
* floating gates -- bias must be in-topology (= the published form, and the
* idiom of the era-binfix gf180 winner). All values sized, none authored.
* Round-1 external, approved 2026-09-11.
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n3 VSS
L L2 n3 VSS
NMOS NM2 n4 VDD n2 VSS
L L3 VDD n4
C C2 n4 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1
